  "description": [
    "A  pyrazolone  that is 1,2-dihydro-3<em>H</em>-pyrazol-3-one substituted by a dimethylamino group at position 4, methyl groups at positions 1 and 5 and a phenyl group at position 2. It exhibits analgesic, anti-inflammatory, and antipyretic properties."
